shlokas.sanskrit_hinglish:
Arjuna uvācha:
 Sannyāsasya mahābāho tattvam ichchhāmi veditum;
 tyāgasya cha hṛiṣhīkeśha pṛithak keśhiniṣhūdana ||1||

Śrī Bhagavān uvācha:
 Kāmyānāṁ karmaṇāṁ nyāsaṁ sannyāsaṁ kavayo viduḥ;
 sarva-karma-phala-tyāgaṁ prāhus tyāgaṁ vichakṣhaṇāḥ ||2||

Arjuna uvācha 
 naṣhṭo mohaḥ smṛitir labdhā tvat-prasādān mayāchyuta;
 sthito 'smi gata-sandehaḥ kariṣhye vachanaṁ tava ||73||

Sañjaya uvācha 
 ity ahaṁ vāsudevasya pārthasya cha mahātmanaḥ;
 saṁvādam imam aśrauṣham adbhutaṁ roma-harṣhaṇam ||74||
